    <string name="minkpad_help_overview_title">回溯和概述</string>
    <string name="minkpad_help_overview_description">Use three fingers for Back and the selected operating system’s overview shortcuts. On Mac, swipe up opens Mission Control and swipe down opens App Exposé. Some phones reserve three-finger gestures for screenshots or other system actions. Turn off Advanced host gestures in controller settings to prevent MinkPad from also sending a command. The same host actions remain available in the bottom controls.</string>
